  "source_caption": "Robert Pattinson plays Chris Hansen in A24’s Primetime, and the transformation is already looking wild. Inspired by true events, the film follows To Catch a Predator host Chris Hansen in 2006 as he sets out to make television history.\n\nDirected by Lance Oppenheim (Ren Faire) in his narrative feature debut and written by Ajon Singh. Also starring Merritt Wever, Skyler Gisondo, Phoebe Bridgers, Matthew Maher, Bokeem Woodbine, and Anna Faris.\n\nPrimetime premieres at the 2026 Venice Film Festival and hits theaters September 25.\n\nWhat do you think of Robert Pattinson as Chris Hansen? 👀",
